  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Response to the Tsunami Affected Communities in Southern Thailand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposal has been developed as an emergency response to the December 26, 2004 Tsunami affected communities in the six southern provinces  of Thailand. Thus, the proposal provides a broad flexible framework for affected communities to come up with specific activities that respond to their immediate and medium-term needs.</narrative>
  </description>
